    "text": "centraloregondaily.com\nwebsite\nBend\nNearly 28-year sentence for Bend man in death of his mother\nBy Travis Pittman, Digital Director,\n6 hours agoBEND, Ore. -- A Bend man who was initially charged with murder in the death of his mother was sentenced Tuesday to nearly 28 years in prison on manslaughter and other charges. Joseph Lawrence Smith, 41, pleaded guilty this month to first-degree manslaughter, first-degree criminal mistreatment and aggravated harassment, according to Deschutes County Court records.\n1",
